# Tribunal "Speak to the People": Tienius Delitian, Captain of the Royal Guard
# in the Throne Room, wants the source of the rumors about King Llethan's death
# ("official matter": "Tell me more." 1, then "I'll take care of it." 4: 1).
# Anrel in Llethan Manor, at disposition 70, admits spreading them (50), and
# Tienius takes the report (100).
# Bribes, repeated until they land, raise Anrel. Ref FormIDs carry
# Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_dbhunt --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr05_people
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask official matter
choose 1
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex TR05_People == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell -210 885 -353 0 "Mournhold, Llethan Manor"
until 600 "Anrel"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Anrel
persuade bribe100 until "Anrel"->GetDisposition >= 70
ask King Llethan's death
expect GetJournalIndex TR05_People == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask King Llethan's death
expect GetJournalIndex TR05_People == 100
bye
end
